{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249060/extras/b41a68ea86d812dd6ed328a3098077b1.poster.avif?t=1760863494\" width=1170 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249060/extras/b41a68ea86d812dd6ed328a3098077b1.webm?t=1760863494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249060/extras/b41a68ea86d812dd6ed328a3098077b1.mp4?t=1760863494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A breathtaking metamorphosis awaits as you guide Venya through a world overcome by darkness. Use her shapeshifting powers to restore peace to a land that has gone without, for far too long.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Morph &amp; Traverse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch seamlessly from human to wolf, raccoon, and raven. Each form offers unique traversal and combat mechanics. Glide like a raven through misty canopies, pounce like a wolf across beautiful landscapes, change into a raccoon to slip through tight ruins, and strike like a human with precision. Every form reveals new paths, puzzles, and secrets tucked across Eden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249060/extras/04298cda3a7578991a5df8d2a1df84c6.poster.avif?t=1760863494\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249060/extras/04298cda3a7578991a5df8d2a1df84c6.webm?t=1760863494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249060/extras/04298cda3a7578991a5df8d2a1df84c6.mp4?t=1760863494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fluid form-blending Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master an intricate combo system that blends attacks from different forms. Chain a raccoon\u2019s nimble strikes into a wolf\u2019s feral fury, then follow up with a human\u2019s finishing blow. Master the flow of combat and help restore peace to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249060/extras/adeae62f68fbbd662794eda58aaf1f7b.poster.avif?t=1760863494\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249060/extras/adeae62f68fbbd662794eda58aaf1f7b.webm?t=1760863494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249060/extras/adeae62f68fbbd662794eda58aaf1f7b.mp4?t=1760863494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Blight to Bloom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies and conquer each boss to witness a corrupted area return to its natural beauty. Every victory restores a piece of Eden and reinforces the bond between inner peace and external hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249060/extras/af47a4f39464d6698c38ad5d17c52661.poster.avif?t=1760863494\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249060/extras/af47a4f39464d6698c38ad5d17c52661.webm?t=1760863494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249060/extras/af47a4f39464d6698c38ad5d17c52661.mp4?t=1760863494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Praised in early previews for its \u201csoul-kindling environments\u201d and \u201cinnovative multi-form combat system\u201d, <i>Edenfall:\u00a0Legacy\u00a0of\u00a0the\u00a0First\u00a0Wardens</i> is already turning heads among action-adventure and narrative fans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2249060?t=1760863494","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249060/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760863494","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249060/e3caa8a2894c6921b243910ff38e7b07a0424431/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760863494","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249060/e3caa8a2894c6921b243910ff38e7b07a0424431/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760863494","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3059410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249060/extras/b41a68ea86d812dd6ed328a3098077b1.poster.avif?t=1760863494\" width=1170 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249060/extras/b41a68ea86d812dd6ed328a3098077b1.webm?t=1760863494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249060/extras/b41a68ea86d812dd6ed328a3098077b1.mp4?t=1760863494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A breathtaking metamorphosis awaits as you guide Venya through a world overcome by darkness. Use her shapeshifting powers to restore peace to a land that has gone without, for far too long.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Morph &amp; Traverse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch seamlessly from human to wolf, raccoon, and raven. Each form offers unique traversal and combat mechanics. Glide like a raven through misty canopies, pounce like a wolf across beautiful landscapes, change into a raccoon to slip through tight ruins, and strike like a human with precision. Every form reveals new paths, puzzles, and secrets tucked across Eden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249060/extras/04298cda3a7578991a5df8d2a1df84c6.poster.avif?t=1760863494\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249060/extras/04298cda3a7578991a5df8d2a1df84c6.webm?t=1760863494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249060/extras/04298cda3a7578991a5df8d2a1df84c6.mp4?t=1760863494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fluid form-blending Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master an intricate combo system that blends attacks from different forms. Chain a raccoon\u2019s nimble strikes into a wolf\u2019s feral fury, then follow up with a human\u2019s finishing blow. Master the flow of combat and help restore peace to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249060/extras/adeae62f68fbbd662794eda58aaf1f7b.poster.avif?t=1760863494\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249060/extras/adeae62f68fbbd662794eda58aaf1f7b.webm?t=1760863494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\